      <title>由于水危机持续，鲍威尔湖达到有记录以来的最低水位</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/17/climate/lake-powell-record-low-colorado.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[米德湖和鲍威尔湖的水位自 1957 年以来从未如此低过，凸显了困扰七个依赖科罗拉多河的州的水危机。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/17/climate/lake-powell-record-low-colorado.html</guid>
