      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/17/arts/television/hayden-panettiere-death-foul-play.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在南卡罗来纳州格林维尔当局接到 911 电话后，警方的初步调查没有发现任何“谋杀或可疑情况”的证据。]]></description>
