    <item>
      <title>海顿·潘妮蒂尔去世：《记住泰坦》和《英雄》的主演 36 岁</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/17/arts/television/hayden-panettiere-dead.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[今年五月，她在经历了动荡的十年后出版了一本回忆录，其中包括抑郁症、药物滥用、失去女儿的监护权和一段时间的康复治疗。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/17/arts/television/hayden-panettiere-dead.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 16:42:21 GMT</pubDate>
